<title>EGYPT: Egypt overnight rates narrow, one-week steady.</title>
<headline>Egypt overnight rates narrow, one-week steady.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian pound overnight interbank rates narrowed on Monday to between 10 1/4 and 10 3/8 percent in a very short private sector market, compared with 10 and 10 7/16 percent on Sunday, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates on the pound were steady in a short private sector market at between 10 1/4 and 10 7/16.</p>
<p>Public sector banks held the minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
